{"format":"mandarin-paket","version":1,"id":"hsk-h3-23","typ":"text","titel":"买鞋 · Schuhe kaufen","thema":"HSK 3","beschreibung":"Zusatztext HSK 3, 16 Sätze.","saetze":[{"nr":1,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["的","de"],["鞋","xié"],["已经","yǐ jīng"],["穿","chuān"],["了","le"],["三","sān"],["年","nián"],["了","le"],["，"],["又","yòu"],["旧","jiù"],["又","yòu"],["不","bù"],["舒服","shū fu"],["。"]],"de":"Meine Schuhe trage ich schon drei Jahre, sie sind alt und unbequem.","audio":"audio/01.mp3","langsam":"audio/01-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":2,"w":[["星期天","Xīng qī tiān"],["，"],["我","wǒ"],["去","qù"],["商店","shāng diàn"],["买","mǎi"],["新","xīn"],["鞋","xié"],["。"]],"de":"Am Sonntag gehe ich neue Schuhe kaufen.","audio":"audio/02.mp3","langsam":"audio/02-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":3,"w":[["商店","Shāng diàn"],["里","lǐ"],["的","de"],["鞋","xié"],["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["，"],["有","yǒu"],["黑色","hēi sè"],["的","de"],["、"],["白色","bái sè"],["的","de"],["，"],["也","yě"],["有","yǒu"],["蓝色","lán sè"],["的","de"],["。"]],"de":"Im Laden gibt es viele Schuhe: schwarze, weisse und auch blaue.","audio":"audio/03.mp3","langsam":"audio/03-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":4,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["看","kàn"],["上","shàng"],["了","le"],["一","yì"],["双","shuāng"],["白色","bái sè"],["的","de"],["运动鞋","yùn dòng xié"],["。"]],"de":"Mir gefällt ein Paar weisse Turnschuhe.","audio":"audio/04.mp3","langsam":"audio/04-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":5,"w":[["服务员","Fú wù yuán"],["问","wèn"],["我","wǒ"],["："],["“"],["您","nín"],["穿","chuān"],["多","duō"],["大","dà"],["的","de"],["？"],["”"]],"de":"Die Verkäuferin fragt: «Welche Grösse haben Sie?»","audio":"audio/05.mp3","langsam":"audio/05-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":6,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["说","shuō"],["："],["“"],["四十三","sì shí sān"],["号","hào"],["。"],["”"]],"de":"Ich sage: «Dreiundvierzig.»","audio":"audio/06.mp3","langsam":"audio/06-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":7,"w":[["她","Tā"],["拿","ná"],["来","lái"],["一","yì"],["双","shuāng"],["，"],["我","wǒ"],["穿","chuān"],["上","shàng"],["以后","yǐ hòu"],["走","zǒu"],["了","le"],["走","zǒu"],["，"],["觉得","jué de"],["有点儿","yǒu diǎnr"],["小","xiǎo"],["。"]],"de":"Sie bringt ein Paar, ich ziehe es an, gehe ein paar Schritte und finde es etwas klein.","audio":"audio/07.mp3","langsam":"audio/07-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":8,"w":[["她","Tā"],["又","yòu"],["拿","ná"],["来","lái"],["一","yì"],["双","shuāng"],["四十四","sì shí sì"],["号","hào"],["的","de"],["，"],["这","zhè"],["双","shuāng"],["很","hěn"],["舒服","shū fu"],["。"]],"de":"Sie bringt ein Paar in Grösse 44, das ist sehr bequem.","audio":"audio/08.mp3","langsam":"audio/08-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":9,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["问","wèn"],["："],["“"],["这","zhè"],["双","shuāng"],["鞋","xié"],["多少","duō shao"],["钱","qián"],["？"],["”"]],"de":"Ich frage: «Was kosten diese Schuhe?»","audio":"audio/09.mp3","langsam":"audio/09-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":10,"w":[["她","Tā"],["说","shuō"],["："],["“"],["六百","liù bǎi"],["块","kuài"],["。"],["”"]],"de":"Sie sagt: «Sechshundert Yuan.»","audio":"audio/10.mp3","langsam":"audio/10-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":11,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["觉得","jué de"],["有点儿","yǒu diǎnr"],["贵","guì"],["，"],["问","wèn"],["她","tā"],["能","néng"],["不","bù"],["能","néng"],["便宜","pián yi"],["一点儿","yì diǎnr"],["。"]],"de":"Ich finde das etwas teuer und frage, ob es günstiger geht.","audio":"audio/11.mp3","langsam":"audio/11-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":12,"w":[["她","Tā"],["说","shuō"],["："],["“"],["今天","jīn tiān"],["是","shì"],["周末","zhōu mò"],["，"],["买","mǎi"],["鞋","xié"],["可以","kě yǐ"],["便宜","pián yi"],["一百","yì bǎi"],["块","kuài"],["。"],["”"]],"de":"Sie sagt: «Heute ist Wochenende, Schuhe gibt es hundert Yuan günstiger.»","audio":"audio/12.mp3","langsam":"audio/12-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":13,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["很","hěn"],["满意","mǎn yì"],["，"],["就","jiù"],["买","mǎi"],["了","le"],["。"]],"de":"Ich bin zufrieden und kaufe sie.","audio":"audio/13.mp3","langsam":"audio/13-langsam.mp3"},{"nr":14,"w":[["她","Tā"],["还","hái"],["问","wèn"],["我","wǒ"],["要","yào"],["不","bú"],["要","yào"],["买","mǎi"],["一","yì"],["条","tiáo"],["裤子","kù zi"],["或者","huò zhě"],["一","yí"],["件","jiàn"],["衬衫","chèn shān"],["。"]],"de":"Sie fragt noch, ob ich eine Hose oder 